{"code":"000300","name":"DH오토넥스","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1967년 설립되었고 2024년 DH그룹에 편입된 자동차 부품 전문 기업임. 1998년 차량용 LPG 연료탱크 양산으로 자동차 부품 산업에 진출, 용접 및 프레스 기반 제조 기술력을 활용해 연료 저장 장치와 열관리 부품을 주력 생산하고 있음. 현대차, 기아, 현대모비스에 제품 공급하며 전기차·수소차용 부품, 액체수소 저장 용기 등 미래형 모빌리티 핵심 부품 개발에 역량을 집중하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-11-27","n_days":300,"close":4200.0,"open":4200.0,"high":4200.0,"low":4200.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":111.6935,"ma20":4200.0,"ma60":4200.0,"ma120":4200.0,"ma200":4200.0,"close_vs_ma200":0.0,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"ma50":4200.0,"ma150":4200.0,"ma200_chg_21":2.156,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":76.3707,"r2_250":0.3783,"high52":4200.0,"low52":1984.0,"pos_52w":100.0,"dd_52w":0.0,"from_low52":111.6935,"mdd_1y":0.0,"atr14_pct":0.0,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"stop_atr2_pct":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":null,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":2.09,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-4.0,"op_margin_q":-5.3333,"op_qoq":78.9474,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-150.0,"rev_yoy":-15.7303,"op_trend_4q":-93.7313,"fin_period":"202609","roe":-5.7,"debt_ratio":66.87,"per":null,"pbr":5.81,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":2.09,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct"